node_modules/

# cache/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The cached verdicts hold no key material — only model
# output over fictional data — and committing them is what lets a fresh clone run the whole
# walkthrough without an inference endpoint. Delete the folder and re-warm to rebuild it.
